What does the variable encode? If it is an actual number of repetitions
(n=1, 2, 3...), then I would treat it as numeric.

Treating it as an ordered factor should be the case if the levels of
"repetition" are categories (say, something like "short", "medium",
"long", ...).

Hope this helps,
João

